BLAST RADIUS
  Every uncaught framework error in every debug build of UserApp is invisible on the console:
  RenderFlex overflows, "RenderBox was not laid out", assertion failures, red-screen details.
  Any QA pass that read "no exceptions in logcat" as clean was reading a silenced channel.

DIRECT CONSEQUENCE FOR NEARS-1718
  docs/solutions/NEARS-1718-chat-order-id-row-overflow.md §4.3 specifies AC4's instrument as
  "the live app, pre-fix, read off RenderFlex's own report ... Flutter prints
  'A RenderFlex overflowed by NN pixels on the right.'". In THIS app that print does not exist.
  §4.3 steps 3/4/5 and §8 QA points 1/2 are not executable as written, in either direction:
  step 5's en control would have produced its required "zero" for the wrong reason.

SUGGESTED FIX SHAPE (not applied — QA does not write product code)
  FlutterError.onError = (FlutterErrorDetails details) {
    FlutterError.presentError(details);                       // keep the console/logcat dump
